# --- this fork's additions ---

# Credentials and session material, never in git. A tunnel key or a workspace
# cookie committed once stays in the history even after it is deleted, and the
# upstream repo has no such files, so nothing here shadows a tracked path.
devbridge*.key
*.devbridge-key
cookie*.txt
cookie*.json
*hlp_token*
.env
.env.*
secrets/
/tmp/

